                                                "sense_id": "6b366962-549f-3d4d-baf8-be2f8a2dd5e9",
                                                "text": "On a tour of the cavernous and gleaming BrewDog plant in Ellon, just north of Aberdeen, Dickie happily batted around terminology – IBU, ABV, pH, haze, present gravity, headspace oxygen – with PhD-level microbiologists working in the lab."
