                                                "sense_id": "6b366962-549f-3d4d-baf8-be2f8a2dd5e9",
                                                "text": "No, because we obsessively clean it (or use paper coverings at work), said microbiologist Charles Gerba, a professor of public health, environmental science and immunology at the University of Arizona."
